Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 17:20:23 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] database: remember the transport of a message (SMS/MMS or
 RCS)

A transport column (NULL for SMS and MMS through ModemManager, 'rcs' for
RCS chat through IMSroha), and the lookups the RCS transport needs: our id
for an imdn.Message-ID, and the unread RCS messages of a chat (for their
displayed notifications).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01L5scTQJJDo2PTt6GBeDFah
